---
---

<section class="guard-demo section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">
      Never commit as the<br />
      <span class="accent-text">wrong person again.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="terminal-wrapper">
      <div class="terminal-static">
        <div class="terminal-header">
          <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
          <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-body">
          <div class="terminal-line">
            <span class="prompt">$</span>
            <span class="command">git commit -m "fix critical auth bug"</span>
          </div>
          <br/>
          <div class="terminal-line warning">
            <span class="icon">⚠</span> gitsetu: Identity mismatch detected!
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line indent">
            Expected: <span class="accent">engineering@company.com</span> (profile: work)
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-line indent">
            Actual:   <span class="error">personal@gmail.com</span>
          </div>
          <br/>
          <div class="terminal-line indent error-bold">
            Commit blocked. Run 'gitsetu status' to check your profiles.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="guard-caption">
      <p>
        GitSetu's pre-commit guard is fail-closed.<br />
        If your identity doesn't match, the commit is blocked — not warned.
      </p>
      <p class="guard-note">
        <strong class="accent">Privacy Guard-Rail:</strong> GitSetu enforces <code>useConfigOnly = true</code> globally.<br />
        Commits in unmapped directories are strictly blocked to prevent global identity leakage.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guard-demo {
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }

  .guard-caption {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .guard-caption p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .guard-caption .guard-note {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .guard-note code {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    color: var(--text-heading);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .terminal-wrapper {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .terminal-static {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-error);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card), 0 0 40px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.1);
    border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
  }

  .terminal-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .terminal-dot {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  .terminal-dot.red { background: #ff5f56; }
  .terminal-dot.yellow { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .terminal-dot.green { background: #27c93f; }

  .terminal-body {
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .terminal-line {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .prompt {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .command {
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  .warning {
    color: var(--color-warning);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .warning .icon {
    font-size: 1.1em;
  }

  .indent {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .accent {
    color: var(--accent-primary);
  }

  .error {
    color: var(--color-error);
  }

  .error-bold {
    color: var(--color-error);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .terminal-body {
      padding: var(--space-md);
      font-size: var(--text-xs);
    }
  }
</style>
